{"title":"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be a positive integer and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7ed455825923c16a03807c62ba493df7f9123aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 \\le x_2 \\le \\cdots \\le x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" /> be real numbers. Prove that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/0/ad091920cb01959f69cc0f1b7ce863992acab98e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left( \\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\sum_{j=i}^{n} |x_i-x_j|\\right)^2 \\le \\frac{2(n^2-1)}{3}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\sum_{j=i}^{n}(x_i-x_j)^2\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"58\" />\n</p><p>with equality if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdf2bfb81e611b29c9d9a8b45ffc6bbcbe1cb39f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1, x_2, ..., x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"11\" /> form an arithmetic sequence.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p><p>\\begin{align*}\\left(\\sum_{i,j=1}^{n}|x_i-x_j|\\right)^2 &amp;=\\left(2\\sum_{1\\le i\\le j\\le n}(x_j-x_i)\\right)^2 \\\\\n&amp;= \\left((2n-2)x_n+(2n-6)x_{n-1}+\\dots +(2-2n)x_1\\right)^2 \\\\\n&amp;\\le ((2n-2)^2+(2n-6)^2+(2n-10)^2+\\dots + (2-2n)^2)(x_1^2+x_2^2+\\dots + x_n^2) \\\\\n&amp;= \\frac{4(n-1)(n)(n+1)}{3}(x_1^2+x_2^2+\\dots + x_n^2) \\\\\n&amp;= \\frac{2(n^2-1)}{3}\\cdot 2(nx_1^2 + nx_2^2 + \\dots + nx_n^2) \\\\\n&amp;= \\frac{2(n^2-1)}{3}\\cdot 2\\left((n-1)\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{n}{x_i^2}\\right) + \\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{n}{x_i}\\right)^2 - 2\\sum_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le n}x_ix_j\\right) \\\\\n&amp;= \\frac{2(n^2-1)}{3}\\cdot 2\\left(\\sum_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le n}(x_i-x_j)^2\\right) \\\\\n&amp;= \\frac{2(n^2-1)}{3}\\sum_{i,j=1}^{n}(x_i-x_j)^2\n\\end{align*}\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO\" title=\"2003 IMO\">2003 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202449\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1317/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 827/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.333      1 -total\n 52.48%    6.472      1 Template:IMO_box\n 46.16%    5.693      1 Template:Solution\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25815:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202449 and revision id 262482. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}